        "name": "Sentinel Tactical Harness",
        "shortName": "Sentinel",
        "description": "A rugged modular chest rig designed for long-term field use. The Sentinel balances storage and protection, featuring reinforced webbing, quick-access mag pouches, and a padded frame to distribute weight evenly. Popular among PMCs and ex-military contractors for its reliability in extended operations where mobility and gear access mean survival."
